From 010a3056809865e0cdb96595946a45fcb9a9ebc4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 16:22:50 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] pcbnew: AI chat panel (Claude Agent SDK bridge over the IPC
 API)

A dockable panel in the board editor (View > Panels > AI Chat). The AI runs
in a separate Python process (scripting/kicad_ai/bridge.py) that reads and
edits the open board through the IPC API (kicad-python). Code that changes
the board is shown to the user and runs only after approval, every time;
each run is one undo step and is dropped on error. Checks and renders work
on a saved copy with kicad-cli. Authentication uses the user's own API key
stored in the OS keyring.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
